# Token discipline

- Open only the files/slices needed; stop expanding once the owning module is known.
- Prefer codebase-memory MCP over repo-wide greps and reading large docs/CSS.
- Never scan `node_modules/`, `target/`, `.next/`, `dist/`, build caches, logs, or binaries for behavior.
- Keep rules and replies short; no restating the task or dumping whole trackers into context.
